<programme start="20261101141000 +0000" stop="20261101144200 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Battle of the Alphas</title><sub-title lang="en">South America</sub-title><desc lang="en">Learning to fight dirty with a guanaco, headbutting a fellow iguana to claim a piece of prime territory, and meeting a hermit crab who forcibly evicts a tenant from its shell.</desc><date>20240213</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/1a4af1a91e3749040136437c7846098d.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101144200 +0000" stop="20261101151400 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Battle of the Alphas</title><sub-title lang="en">Southeast Asia</sub-title><desc lang="en">With real-life dueling dragons, giant sumo-wrestling beetles, street-fighting monkeys, and sea turtles that play king of the hill - on top of another sea turtle, Southeast Asia boasts a wide range of wildlife warriors.</desc><date>20240213</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/e633c122025de7792f39980db2512f46.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101151400 +0000" stop="20261101154600 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Battle of the Alphas</title><sub-title lang="en">USA</sub-title><desc lang="en">Bighorn rams rattle the mountaintops; Brown bears battle, desperate to fatten up for winter; Sharp-tailed grouse shake their tail-feathers; Wild stallions rumble with beauty and grace.</desc><date>20240213</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.8.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E09</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/f3b27de0a4ca82702a1866cd5fa64f6c.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101154600 +0000" stop="20261101161800 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Battle of the Alphas</title><sub-title lang="en">Europe</sub-title><desc lang="en">From the Highlands to the Alps, Europe&apos;s evocative landscapes are the backdrop for epic wildlife drama; normally stoic red deer go wild during the rut; wolf packs clash over territory, and foxes do the foxtrot, but it&apos;s not as nice as it sounds.</desc><date>20240214</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.9.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E10</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/f5379e40ac692705c999451900707fa8.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101161800 +0000" stop="20261101165100 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Battle of the Alphas</title><sub-title lang="en">South Africa</sub-title><desc lang="en">Wildebeest battle for herd hierarchy, meerkats live the thug life, floppy fish fight it out on land and locusts give up their vegetarian ways in a frenzy of cannibalism; it all happens on the wild and wide-open landscape of South Africa.</desc><date>20240214</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.10.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E11</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/015644bbc94bf9110048f58c0767536f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101165100 +0000" stop="20261101172300 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Battle of the Alphas</title><sub-title lang="en">Sub Sahara</sub-title><desc lang="en">The latitudes south of the Sahara offer vastly different battlegrounds for a wide range of warriors; male giraffes swing their heads like wrecking balls, zebras boast the most powerful kick in the animal kingdom, and chimpanzee warfare is familiar.</desc><date>20240214</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.11.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E12</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/8322d1ac0d327e0f829f78a775127ad5.jpeg"/></programme>
