<programme start="20261031180000 +0000" stop="20261031190000 +0000" channel="The Weather Channel US"><title lang="en">American Supernatural</title><sub-title lang="en">Wicked Witch of Winter</sub-title><desc lang="en">In the late 17th century, accused witch, Moll Dyer, was burned out of her home with flames and fury during a deadly freeze. Legend says she froze to death moments after cursing the town in a vengeful rage.</desc><credits><actor>Gary Ayash</actor><actor>Vaughn Bullard</actor></credits><category lang="en">Environmental</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p11066564_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
