<programme start="20261101010000 +0000" stop="20261101020000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Natanael y Gustavo sacan a Sofía de la cárcel. Mariano y Livia pasan la noche juntos. Rafael le pide matrimonio a Laura, y Diego a Melissa.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20191219</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.42.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E43</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/fee45038a50acfc90d640863677b5550.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101020000 +0000" stop="20261101030000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">La mamá de Samuel le pide perdón por no aceptarlo antes como es. Liberan a Gael de la cárcel. Nadia está obsesionada con que Toña y Bruno vuelvan.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20191220</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.43.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E44</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c0dd6615a75519209f1037be8390b01c.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101030000 +0000" stop="20261101040000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Estela cena con Juvenal. Caetana le dice a Dooda que encontró a Laerte tratando de entrar a su cuarto. Toña se convence de seguir el plan de Nadia.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20191223</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.44.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E45</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/f7f2efa1bea1c68b6f506841921fe163.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101040000 +0000" stop="20261101050000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Caetana al fin revela a Elena que su padre es Josafá. Aura y Gael duermen juntos. Laerte habla con Sofía, la chantajea y esta lo mata.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20231030</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.45.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E46</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/585976d6956e9433920632644d1a49e8.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101050000 +0000" stop="20261101070000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">En el burdel Clara llega a ver a Dooda y ve a Laerte en el piso, esta piensa que fue Clara y se echa la culpa. Clara pide a Patrick defenderla.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20231031</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.46.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E47</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/bd13da0c0f8f81a849e11be7f585d0a9.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261101070000 +0000" stop="20261101080000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">Moisés y los diez mandamientos</title><sub-title lang="es">Moisés y los diez mandamientos</sub-title><desc lang="es">La historia de Moisés desde su nacimiento y llegada a manos de la princesa Henutmire hasta llevar a su pueblo a la Tierra Prometida. Su crianza como un verdadero príncipe egipcio junto a su tío Ramsés.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Guilherme Winter</actor><actor>Sérgio Marone</actor><actor>Camila Rodrigues</actor><actor>Giselle Itié</actor><actor>Petrônio Gontijo</actor><actor>Gabriela Durlo</actor><actor>Giuseppe Oristânio</actor><actor>Luciano Szafir</actor><actor>Juliana Didone</actor><actor>Eduardo Lago</actor><actor>Thierry Figueira</actor></credits><date>20241207</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.83.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E84</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/23ccf74e7675afc6f806c658d984b544.jpeg"/></programme>
