<programme start="20261031170000 +0000" stop="20261031200000 +0000" channel="TSN 4 🇨🇦"><title lang="en">CFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Winnipeg Blue Bombers at Toronto Argonauts</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Toronto Argonauts host the Winnipeg Blue Bombers in the CFL Division Semifinals at BMO Field. Both sides finished 9-9, but Toronto arrives having lost their last three, while Winnipeg won their most recent game, 34-10 over BC.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191256_b_v11_ak.jpg"/></programme>
