<programme start="20261031203000 +0000" stop="20261031233000 +0000" channel="TSN 4 🇨🇦"><title lang="en">CFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Saskatchewan Roughriders at BC Lions</sub-title><desc lang="en">The BC Lions host the Saskatchewan Roughriders in the CFL Division Semifinals at BC Place. Both sides finished 10-8 in the West Division, and the Lions have won the last two meetings at home, including a 31-24 victory in September.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191256_b_v11_ak.jpg"/></programme>
